      {
        "type": "p",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "2ndアルバムのリリースが発表されました。"
          }
        ],
        "zh": [
          [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "第二张专辑的发售消息公布啦。"
            }
          ]
        ],
        "en": [
          [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "The release of my 2nd album has been announced."
            }
          ]
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "p",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "アルバムタイトルは"
          }
        ],
        "zh": [
          [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "专辑的名字是"
            }
          ]
        ],
        "en": [
          [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "The album title is"
            }
          ]
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "p",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "アルストロメリア"
          }
        ],
        "zh": [
          [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "《六出花》"
            }
          ]
        ],
        "en": [
          [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Alstroemeria"
            }
          ]
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "p",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "2017.12.20       発売"
          }
        ],
        "zh": [
          [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "2017.12.20       发售"
            }
          ]
        ],
        "en": [
          [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Release date: 2017.12.20"
            }
          ]
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "p",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "花びらに足跡のような模様がついているのが特徴的なお花の名前からとりました🐾"
          }
        ],
        "zh": [
          [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "专辑名取自一种花的名字，那种花的花瓣上带有类似足迹的纹路🐾"
            }
          ]
        ],
        "en": [
          [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "I took the name from a flower known for the footprint-like markings on its petals🐾"
            }
          ]
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "p",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "1stアルバム「nowhere」から約一年半ぶりのリリースとなります。私と、私のそばにいてくれるみんなのこれまでと、これからの足跡はどうペタペタされているのか？いくのかな？"
          }
        ],
        "zh": [
          [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "这是距第一张专辑《nowhere》约一年半后的新专辑。我和一直陪伴在我身边的大家，迄今为止的足迹会被怎样一步步印下呢？今后的足迹又会走向何方呢？"
            }
          ]
        ],
        "en": [
          [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "This is my first release in about a year and a half since my 1st album \"nowhere\". What do the footprints that I and all of you who are by my side have left so far, and will leave from now on, look like, I wonder? How will they go?"
            }
          ]
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "p",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "これまでの軌跡を信じて制作がんばりますᕦ(ò_óˇ)ᕤ"
          }
        ],
        "zh": [
          [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "我会相信一路走来的轨迹，努力完成这张专辑的ᕦ(ò_óˇ)ᕤ"
            }
          ]
        ],
        "en": [
          [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Believing in the path we've walked so far, I'll do my best on the production ᕦ(ò_óˇ)ᕤ"
            }
          ]
        ]
      },
