              "type": "text",
              "text": "今天迎来大型更新的《在地下城寻求邂逅是否搞错了什么～记忆憧憬～》的新主题曲《Ivy》也会收录进专辑里。"
            }
          ]
        ],
        "en": [
          [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "\"Ivy\", the new theme song for \"Is It Wrong to Try to Pick Up Girls in a Dungeon? ~Memoria Freese~\", which got a major update today, will also be included on the album."
